        "quote": "立刻带她去医院急诊或产科急诊，不要延误。"
      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00120",
        "explanation": "Later turn confirms that admission/observation is the standard, correct and necessary arrangement for postpartum preeclampsia risk.",
